[{"client_msg_id":"76557DC0-1FA5-4BD1-9A4C-5D65B03965B1","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"お近くなら店の様子をみたり、一度利用をぜひ！職人のお仕事っぷりの感想ぜひ聞いてみたいです。 :grinning: ","ts":"1619952819.118100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5PM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77a96225-7728-4c9b-9ff9-7c4ae31feab6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"お、合羽橋道具街じゃん","ts":"1619951239.114100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TwCK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21B205B9-9501-418D-8598-6A47A09DD056","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"私も研ぎで同じ悩み持ってます...\n\n越前ダマスカス鋼製を包丁自分で研ぐ自信がなくて、製造元工房に「私が住んでいる市内に適切に扱ってくれるオススメの刃物研ぎの店を知っていたら教えて欲しい」と聞いたら、市内にはないけど都内でひとつだけ存在し、浅草（稲荷町？）のかまた刃研社を紹介してもらえました。\n\nちょっと遠くて利用は厳しいんだけど、教室も開催しているみたいなので興味ありありです。\n\u003chttps://www.kap-kam.com/|https://www.kap-kam.com/\u003e","ts":"1619944499.113600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qYC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb2bc56c-8ef2-4b1b-876a-9f4f7a96d2f0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"デカイのと小さいのしかないので中間サイズが欲しい","ts":"1619940010.102000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j0S/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28bce60c-8821-4129-9439-6c3d24ec0c32","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"包丁一つ買いたいと思ってるので次は研ぎについて聞いて買ってみようかな","ts":"1619939987.101900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l7ax"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7255c7b-713e-47c8-aca5-63ea66379e7e","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"包丁自体は、多分特筆するほど良いもんじゃないですけど","ts":"1619939815.101800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3JTf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cac56d37-0135-4048-8736-d92660670805","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"一回研ぎ直してもらいま