P8VD","text":"↑ 結構良さそうね。","ts":"1619931478.099300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nLiO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b68cfe1-229a-4d00-b565-dbe20521c7d7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"目的が「砥石で刃物を研げるようになりたい」ならとりあえずこんな感じの安めのセットを買ってやってみるのが良いと思う。\n\u003chttps://www.kai-group.com/store/products/detail/457\u003e","ts":"1619931463.098900","attachments":[{"fallback":"コンビ砥石セット(#400・#1000) | 貝印オンラインストア","id":1,"title":"コンビ砥石セット(#400・#1000) | 貝印オンラインストア","title_link":"https://www.kai-group.com/store/products/detail/457","text":"「コンビ砥石セット(#400・#1000)_AP0305」ならKAIストア。貝印運営のオンラインストア「KAI ストア」は包丁・鍋などのキッチン用品、製菓用品、カミソリやビューティーケアツールなどの美容用品の総合通販サイトです。あなたの、より快適なライフスタイルをサポートします。","image_url":"https://www.kai-group.com/store/assets/images/product/000ap0305_ws1.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"kai-group.com","service_icon":"https://www.kai-group.com/store/html/user_data/assets/img/common/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.kai-group.com/store/products/detail/457","original_url":"https://www.kai-group.com/store/products/detail/457"}],"edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1619931615.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cnq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"009f8dee-035e-424e-ab79-328d2f590454","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"アナログな技術は習得に時間かかるし、再現性を獲得しようとするともっとかかる。だから計測器具とか治具とかでデジタルに落とし込むんだけども、そうなると金銭コストが嵩むと。","ts":"1619931207.097500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y3m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d11f73e-b996-41aa-a16b-bc6fe16984c1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"研ぎ石はそのあとでも良いと思うよ。ぶっちゃけちゃんと切れるように研ぐには技術が要るんで、動機付けの損益分岐が難しいと思う。","ts":"1619931072.096000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m4NT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72a5b4d2-0782-48a1-ac04-ec9b26398d12","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もしくはお店で聞いて新品の包丁買って最初に紙を切ってみるとか。","ts":"1619931000.094800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5cN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c703db3-d490-4696-b3a5-fd7fcd1b5894","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"普通の刃物で紙切ると痛むからね。\n\nそれでも1回やってみたいっていう話なら、まずは包丁研ぎ屋さんに持っていって、それをやってみたいから研いでくれって頼んでみたら。","ts":"1619930945.094000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"riR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58792a5e-5d84-44c3-b20d-bfc82b1e14d7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まず包丁で紙を切ってはいけない。","ts":"1619930757.092400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VbF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7edd88c5-9d5f-4329-8079-84f05e79e8b2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"丁寧に状態みつつ研げばいけるんだろうけど、まあシャープナーだとちょっと難しいだろうなあ(シャープナーがわるいわけではない)","ts":"1619929754.092000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PwB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37018108-5224-4ee7-99b5-43336fa78c0e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"youtubeで見るようなキッチンペーパーをスッとやってスッと切れるようにはならんですね\n（ぶっちゃけそれがやってみたいのが一番ある）","ts":"1619929643.091100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OAb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cfb537d-be9d-44b3-938f-27a3c637f797","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"コロンさんと同じの使ってるけど、使い方が悪いのかな","ts":"1619929577.091000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdf1d2db-c8b2-4920-a987-55f98edfeea0","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"黒がどうとかいう中2っぽい名前のやつを、荒いのから細かいの3番手分。","ts":"1619927908.090900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z1d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13c368ff-f296-4cf2-94e1-ee